                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e6d218dc-e235-3c6a-af33-4d8eb861c281",
                        "entry_id": "0bbdf6b4-0bf0-38b9-8853-285b0f1d875a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "high official, dignitary"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e4b4a54-5d9f-4cd4-b706-45a532402694",
                                "sense_id": "e6d218dc-e235-3c6a-af33-4d8eb861c281",
                                "text": "Нежда́нов наклони́л го́лову, а Сипя́гин прости́лся с ним на францу́зский мане́р, не́сколько раз сря́ду бы́стро поднеся́ ру́ку к со́бственным губа́м и но́су, и пошёл да́лее, бо́йко разма́хивая тро́стью и посви́стывая — во́все не как ва́жный чино́вник и́ли сано́вник, а как до́брый ру́сский country-gentleman.",
                                "translation": "Nezhdanov bowed, while Sipyagin parted from him in the French fashion, raising his hand several times in rapid succession to his lips and nose, and walked on, smartly swinging his cane and whistling, not at all like an important official or dignitary, but like a good-natured Russian country gentleman.",
                                "english": "Nezhdanov bowed, while Sipyagin parted from him in the French fashion, raising his hand several times in rapid succession to his lips and nose, and walked on, smartly swinging his cane and whistling, not at all like an important official or dignitary, but like a good-natured Russian country gentleman."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
